### Get CW Lookup Data (6 categories)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/LookupData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CW"
}

###

### Get FTE Lookup Data (8 categories)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/LookupData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "FTE"
}

###

### Test Invalid Type (should return 400 error)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/LookupData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "INVALID"
}

###

### Test Empty Type (should return 400 error)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/LookupData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": ""
}

